# Call sites of the original services.jar that call a static method of
# the device's aim-services.jar instead (ADR 0013, #702 D1;
# docs/system-services.md, "Redirected call sites"): the derived image's
# services.jar has the target's method id, and every call of `call` in
# the methods named `caller` is an invoke-static of `to` with the same
# registers (`cargo aim build system-server`). `to` takes an instance
# call's receiver first, then its arguments, and returns its result.
# `calls` is how many calls there are; the build fails if the original
# makes another number, or `to` is not a public static method of that
# signature.
#
# caller (class.method)   call (class.method)   to (class.method)   calls   reason
com.android.server.SystemServer.startBootstrapServices com.android.server.pm.PackageManagerService.main dev.aim.server.PackageBootstrapBridge.startPackageManager 1 Attach the synchronous M4 package-policy bridge after PlatformCompat and before original PMS scanning; original PMS remains until C acceptance gates (#834, #798).
